'' An aggregate initializer with more expressions than the type has slots is refused;
'' too few is not. A union is one slot, an anonymous aggregate is one, 'extends' is one,
'' and a method is none.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/init-too-many.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' GOLDEN: expected/init-too-many.out
